# Knowunity voice recall prototype

## What this is
A mocked voice-based active recall prototype for Knowunity, built as a 390px dark-mode iOS web app and deployed to Vercel.

## Hard rules
- Mobile only, 390px, dark mode only. No light mode, no desktop.
- Every color, size and spacing value comes from tokens.json.
  Never invent one. If something is missing, stop and tell me.
- Build from the components that already exist. If nothing fits,
  stop and tell me before you make a new one.
- The recall is mocked. No speech-to-text, no audio, no model calls.
- Knowie replies in text. Never speaks.
- Sentence case on every label and button.

## Never
- No CSS fallback values like var(--token, #333).
- No new dependencies without asking.

## Where things are
- tokens.json         every value. read before writing any style
- design-system.md    which component to use, and when not to
- design-brief.md     read when building a state I haven't specified
- voice-ux.md         read when designing any recall state
- reference/          screenshots. look when matching a layout
